---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Demo music credits"
description: "Music and artwork credits for the Cueport product demo."
permalink: /demo-music/
viewportMain: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="page-head">
    <p class="paper-kicker">Demo music credits</p>
    <h1>Music and artwork used in the Cueport demo.</h1>
    <p class="lede">The homepage product demo uses rights-cleared music from
      Pixabay and artwork from Pexels. The tracks and images are used as
      integrated Cueport demo content, not as a standalone music pack or stock
      asset collection.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="music-credit-summary" aria-labelledby="license-basis">
    <h2 id="license-basis" class="paper-head">License basis</h2>
    <p class="paper-item">Audio is listed under the
      <a href="{{ demoMusicCredits.audioLicense.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ demoMusicCredits.audioLicense.name }}</a>.
      Artwork is listed under the
      <a href="{{ demoMusicCredits.artworkLicense.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ demoMusicCredits.artworkLicense.name }}</a>.
      Both sources allow commercial use and do not require attribution. License
      text and source records were last checked {{ demoMusicCredits.lastChecked }}.</p>
    <p class="paper-item">{{ demoMusicCredits.note }}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="music-credit-sheet" aria-labelledby="track-credits">
    <h2 id="track-credits" class="paper-head">Track credits</h2>
    <div class="music-credit-list">
      {%- for track in demoMusicCredits.tracks %}
        <article class="music-credit-row">
          <div class="music-credit-title">
            <p class="music-credit-num">{{ loop.index }}</p>
            <h3>{{ track.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ track.artist }}</p>
          </div>
          <p><strong>Audio</strong> <a href="{{ track.audioUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ track.audioSource }}</a></p>
          <p><strong>Artwork</strong> <a href="{{ track.artworkUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ track.artworkSource }}</a></p>
        </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>
